{"text": "gratitude", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\">gratitude</i>, from Medieval Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">gr\u0101tit\u016bd\u014d</i> (\u201cthankfulness\u201d), from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">gr\u0101tus</i> (\u201cthankful\u201d). Displaced native Old English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"ang\">\u00feancung</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "The state of being grateful.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u02c8\u0261\u0279\u00e6t\u026at(j)ud/"]]}